      "content": "10.1 Literacy — Among India's Highest"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Tripura consistently ranks among the top Indian states in terms of literacy rates, exceeding 87%.",
        "Tripura University was established in 1987 and was elevated to a Central University in 2007.",
        "National Institute of Technology (NIT) Agartala was converted from Tripura Engineering College in 2006.",
        "Maharaja Bir Bikram (MBB) College, established in 1947, is the pioneer degree college of the state."
      ],
      "id": "qz2kupl"
    },
